":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Fj16uG6BNZOq5K8mS2HHiQ","review_id":"rSK5ntpMhgEeIRr7iwiKZw","date":"2017-08-09T18:45:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9392390251159668,"text_excerpt":"Ming's is a great neighborhood Chinese joint. I love everything about it, from the food, to the service, to the atmosphere. I had lunch there today and once again, had a wonderful experience. I arrived at peak lunch time, so I sat at the bar and waited for a table. It might have taken all of 2 minutes. Once seated the waitress was super quick in bringing menus and taking our drink order. Drinks were delivered right away and our order was taken. As always our food arrived very timely, and it was hot and delicious. I had the Kung pao chicken with cho-cho and fried rice. Their chi-chos are so perfect! Crispy on the outside with a little pocket of perfectly cooked shrimp and veggies. Yummy! T..."},{"business_id":"Fj16uG6BNZOq5K8mS2HHiQ","review_id":"HxUNGcNcplAISj4IyhWLIA","date":"2016-09-01T23:21:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9391244649887085,"text_excerpt":"A great Chinese restaurant in the Lakeview are of New Orleans. We have eaten in and taken out and it never disappoints. They give huge portions of food for dinner so beware. The fried rice dishes could serve 3 or 4 and the entree dishes could serve at least 2 or 3 people. We like the Mandarin Chicken and the the spring rolls. I've had shrimp dishes and chicken dishes - all every good - very fresh food. It's a keeper."},{"business_id":"Fj16uG6BNZOq5K8mS2HHiQ","review_id":"MdJub6WkEBg0SqQ4z2CWOg","date":"2015-12-14T15:06:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.938483715057373,"text_excerpt":"My daughter wanted some Chinese food Saturday night and she wasn't happy with last two places we tried. A friend had told me about Ming's and how great it was so we looked it up and found the menu and ordered a few things to pick up. She got the honey walnut shrimp and she loved it and I had to try it and it was the best I've ever had! Then we had an order of shrimp fried rice and I was blown away by the amount they gave us. It was enough to feed 6 people and really good. I got the lettuce wraps and it was also very good. We definitely found our new Chinese place and will be trying many things. It's a small place but a really nice setting with an outdoor area and lights very romantic too."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Fj16uG6BNZOq5K8mS2HHiQ","photo_id":"jSV50paMquxouDnXN2TM1A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jSV50paMquxouDnXN2TM1A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8671126365661621},{"business_id":"Fj16uG6BNZOq5K8mS2HHiQ","photo_id":"1TmE4JY14IJ447hnytfF-g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/1TmE4JY14IJ447hnytfF-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8603367209434509},{"business_id":"Fj16uG6BNZOq5K8mS2HHiQ","photo_id":"eIcUb_AWOu-yjRIp-A5ilw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eIcUb_AWOu-yjRIp-A5ilw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8063613772392273},{"business_id":"Fj16uG6BNZOq5K8mS2HHiQ","photo_id":"1ANn-C5b31pZdTUoil4Z8g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1ANn-C5b31pZdTUoil4Z8g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7789336442947388},{"business_id":"Fj16uG6BNZOq5K8mS2HHiQ","photo_id":"idjXxqinxCM8JfbkjanyxQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/idjXxqinxCM8JfbkjanyxQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7741029262542725}]},"notebook_case":null}
